(109, 'So much has been given to me; I have no time to ponder over that which has been denied.', 'Helen Keller'),
(110, 'I have learned that every heart will get what it prays for most.', 'Hafiz'),
(111, 'Appreciation is the highest form of prayer, for it acknowledges the presence of good wherever you shine the light of your thankful thoughts.', 'Alan Cohen'),
(112, 'The soul that gives thanks can find comfort in everything; the soul that complains can find comfort in nothing.', 'Hannah Whitall Smith'),
(113, 'We learned about gratitude and humility — that so many people had a hand in our success.', 'Michelle Obama'),
(114, 'The best way to show my gratitude to God is to accept everything, even my problems, with joy.', 'Mother Teresa'),
(115, 'There''s no happier person than a truly thankful, content person.', 'Joyce Meyer'),
(116, 'He who thanks but with the lips thanks but in part; the full, the true Thanksgiving comes from the heart.', 'J.A. Shedd'),
(117, 'Make it a habit to tell people thank you. To express your appreciation, sincerely and without the expectation of anything in return.', 'Ralph Marston'),
(118, 'I live in the space of thankfulness — and I have been rewarded a million times over for it.', 'Oprah Winfrey'),
